        <mxCell id="legend_box" value="&lt;b&gt;UML 2.5 Component Diagram Notation Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;● &lt;b&gt;&amp;laquo;component&amp;raquo;&lt;/b&gt;: Modular, replaceable execution unit encapsulating specific service logic.&lt;br&gt;● &lt;b&gt;Provided Interface (Ball / Lollipop)&lt;/b&gt;: Operations offered to client components.&lt;br&gt;● &lt;b&gt;Required Interface (Socket)&lt;/b&gt;: Operations required by the component to function.&lt;br&gt;● &lt;b&gt;Assembly Connector&lt;/b&gt;: Direct coupling between a provided and required interface.&lt;br&gt;● &lt;b&gt;Dependency (&amp;laquo;use&amp;raquo; / dashed arrow)&lt;/b&gt;: Usage relationship or asynchronous event topic.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#94a3b8;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=10;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
